text:
• Using AI to collect, store or analyze student data without explicit consent and clear educational
  purpose. Student privacy rights (e.g., FERPA, COPPA) must be maintained;
• Allowing AI to learn passwords, confidential or proprietary or sensitive district data.

next_context:
• All artificial intelligence tools in use;
• The vendors providing such tools;
• The categories of student data collected;
• The extent to which student data is shared; and,
• The educational purpose for which each tool is used.
A parent may revoke consent of any AI-based tool, assignment, or assessment at any time.

